### [03_Hotline_Vue_Sol_Fourches_Ajourees_Stries_Blanches.png](file:///c:/Users/hp/Downloads/BatleBots%20-%20Copie/BatleBots%20-%20Copie/Photos_Reference_Hotline/03_Hotline_Vue_Sol_Fourches_Ajourees_Stries_Blanches.png)
